The daemon never painted idle mode 2 after the OSD word selected
Screensaver. With OSD_CONTROL=1 the OSD poll thread is
the first thing to check: startOsdPoll() returns immediately when it
is 0, so no menu selection is ever applied.
SCREENSAVER_RESULT=FAIL reason=daemon-did-not-apply-selection osd_control=1
